@startuml
title Launcher - Simulation Orchestration Class Diagram

package "launchers" {
  class HydroModPyLauncher {
    +cfg: HydroModPyConfig
    +result: RunResult
    +run()
    +_create_simulation_plan()
    +_run_setup()
    +_run_data()
  }

  class RunResult {
    +simulation_plan: SimulationPlan
    +process_runs_by_id: dict[str, ProcessRun]
    +models_by_run_id: dict[str, object]
    +flow: Flow
    +transport: Transport
    +model_modflow: Modflow | Modflow6
    +model_modpath: Modpath | None
    +model_transport: Mt3dms | Modflow6Transport | None
  }
}

package "hydromodpy.simulation" {
  class SimulationPlanner {
    +build(config)
    +build_default(flow_solver)
  }

  class SimulationPlan {
    +name: str
    +description: str
    +runs: tuple[ProcessRun, ...]
  }

  class ProcessRun {
    +id: str
    +process_id: str
    +process_type: str
    +solver: str
    +depends_on: tuple[str, ...]
  }

  class SimulationRunner {
    +execute(plan, state)
  }
}

package "hydromodpy.process" {
  class Flow
  class Transport
}

package "hydromodpy.solver" {
  interface "Flow Solver Wrapper" as FlowSolver
  class Modflow
  class Modflow6

  interface "Transport Solver Wrapper" as TransportSolver
  class Modpath
  class Mt3dms
  class Modflow6Transport
}

HydroModPyLauncher --> SimulationPlanner : builds
HydroModPyLauncher --> SimulationRunner : delegates execution
HydroModPyLauncher *-- RunResult : owns mutable state

SimulationPlanner ..> SimulationPlan : returns
SimulationPlanner ..> ProcessRun : produces

SimulationPlan *-- "0..*" ProcessRun : runs

RunResult --> SimulationPlan : stores
RunResult --> ProcessRun : indexes by id
RunResult --> Flow : setup phase
RunResult --> Transport : setup phase
RunResult --> FlowSolver : last flow model
RunResult --> TransportSolver : last transport model

SimulationRunner ..> SimulationPlan : consumes ordered runs
SimulationRunner ..> RunResult : reads and updates
SimulationRunner ..> ProcessRun : dispatches
SimulationRunner ..> Flow : uses runtime process
SimulationRunner ..> Transport : uses runtime process
SimulationRunner ..> FlowSolver : instantiates from run.solver
SimulationRunner ..> TransportSolver : instantiates from run.solver

FlowSolver <|.. Modflow
FlowSolver <|.. Modflow6

TransportSolver <|.. Modpath
TransportSolver <|.. Mt3dms
TransportSolver <|.. Modflow6Transport
@enduml
